5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I would like to see why our timelines often slip. I'll look into the decade of delivery schedules by project rationale and weather days in the site diaries.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I'm curious about how we actually use our space! I'll check the booking data for specialist and general rooms and the timetable records on rooms out of service.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I am concerned about the burden on our staff. I will examine staffing posts since the hiring freeze and bench technicians' weekly manual routines.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
