25,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"It seems projects based on comfort often slip by a year, and we've lost six weeks to weather on exposed work.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"I found that general-purpose rooms are in high demand all year, while specialist rooms often sit idle. Also, off-site rentals are costing us.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,George,,"Our grounds staff are depleted, but the technicians hired for online teaching actually have some spare capacity.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Users love spaces that are bookable by anyone. However, hazardous materials in older blocks are causing massive delays.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Mechanical costs are rising by a fifth, and we have no reserve to replace old audiovisual equipment.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Benjamin, if mechanical costs are rising, we must be very careful with any complex plant upgrades.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Mizuki, it sounds like we really need more flexible, general-purpose spaces if the specialist ones are empty.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,George,,"@Shizue, if weather is such a risk, perhaps we should avoid any extensive outdoor renovations this year.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Yumi, I agree. The data shows that versatility is what the campus actually values.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@George, that is a logical point. Outdoor work seems to be a gamble we cannot afford.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Mizuki, does the hazardous material issue affect all ground-floor work, or just specific older buildings?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"@George, would a project that uses existing technicians be easier to manage than one needing grounds staff?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,3,talk,George,,"@Yumi, absolutely. The technicians have the bandwidth; the grounds crew is stretched to the breaking point.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shizue, it seems to be a recurring problem in the older blocks, adding months to the start date.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"It appears we are facing a trifecta of risks: rising mechanical costs, weather delays, and hidden hazardous materials.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
